<nav class="category-tabs" aria-label="Battle categories"><a href="/game/battle">Attack Rivals</a><a href="/game/bounties" aria-current="page"><span class="bounty-label">Bounty List (<span data-bounty-count data-next-expiry="<%= nextBountyExpiry??'' %>"><%= bountyCount %></span>)</span></a></nav>
<p class="compact-help">Deliver the finishing attack that reduces an eligible marked rival to 0 Health to claim the escrowed reward and one kill. Earlier damage earns no share. Bounty gold is separate from ordinary loot. Posting and claiming require level <%= bountyRules.minimumLevel %> and <%= bountyRules.minimumQuests %> completed quests. <%= developmentBotBountiesEnabled?'Player-funded temporary-rival bounties are enabled for development; bots never place or claim.':'Temporary-rival targets require ENABLE_DEV_BOT_BOUNTIES=1 in development.' %></p>
<% if(!bountyBoard.eligible) { %><p class="notice notice-info">Complete five quests and reach level 3 to join the bounty hunt.</p><% } %>
<section class="panel bounty-list"><h2 class="strip-title">Open contracts</h2><p class="compact-help">Bounty hunts cross all levels. An active contract and normal Health / Stamina costs are required; ordinary PvP keeps its level range.</p>
<% if(!bountyBoard.active.length) { %><p class="compact-help">No open bounties. <a href="/game/battle">Choose a rival</a> to place one.</p><% } %>
<% for(const bounty of bountyBoard.active) { const own=bounty.sponsor_id===state.id;const target=bounty.target_id===state.id; %>
<article class="bounty-row"><div><%- include('partials/bounty-attention',{contractId:bounty.id}) %><h3><a class="player-link" href="/game/players/<%= bounty.target_id %>"><%= bounty.name %></a></h3><span>Level <%= bounty.level %> <%= bounty.profile_class %> · <%= bounty.armySize %> army · <%= bounty.health??'–' %> / <%= bounty.max_health??100 %> Health</span><small>Posted by <a class="player-link" href="/game/players/<%= bounty.sponsor_id %>"><%= bounty.sponsor_name %></a> · Expires <time datetime="<%= new Date(bounty.expires_at).toISOString() %>"><%= new Date(bounty.expires_at).toLocaleString('en-GB',{timeZone:'UTC',day:'numeric',month:'short',hour:'2-digit',minute:'2-digit'}) %> UTC</time></small><strong class="gold"><%= bounty.amount.toLocaleString('en') %> gold bounty</strong></div>
<% if(!target&&!own) { %><form method="post" action="/game/battle/attack"><%- include('partials/command-fields') %><input type="hidden" name="targetCharacterId" value="<%= bounty.target_id %>"><input type="hidden" name="bountyId" value="<%= bounty.id %>"><button class="button button-gold" type="submit" aria-label="Hunt <%= bounty.name %>" data-attack-ready="<%= (bounty.claimBlockedReason||bounty.attackBlockedReason)?'false':'true' %>"<% if(!bountyBoard.eligible||state.health<alpha.combat.minimumHealth||state.spirit<1||bounty.claimBlockedReason||bounty.attackBlockedReason) { %> disabled<% } %>>Attack</button></form><% } else { %><small class="muted"><%= target?'You are the target':'Your contract; you cannot claim it' %></small><% } %>
<% if(bounty.claimBlockedReason||bounty.attackBlockedReason) { %><small class="field-hint"><%= bounty.claimBlockedReason||bounty.attackBlockedReason %></small><% } %></article><% } %></section>
<details class="panel bounty-rules"><summary>Bounty rules and limits</summary><p class="compact-help">Use Add to Bounty List near the top of a rival's profile. Place 1–10,000 gold from your unbanked purse; Vault funds must be withdrawn first. The listing fee is 10%, rounded up, minimum 1 gold; review the exact total before confirmation. One active bounty per target. Expiration after 24 hours and cancellation after one hour return the full principal; the disclosed fee is retained.</p><p class="compact-help">Each target can receive 50 successful placements in any rolling 24 hours, shared by all sponsors. Ended contracts still count until their placement leaves that window. After a contract ends, relisting is immediate, including while the target recovers at 0 Health. Posting on yourself or an army ally remains unavailable. Bots never sponsor or claim; they can be targets only when the development flag is enabled. Eligible army allies of the sponsor or target may hunt. Sponsors and targets cannot claim their own contracts. Only the eligible finishing attacker receives the reward and one kill; ordinary wins and knockouts award no kills. The defeated target stays at 0 Health and recovers naturally. Coordinated account ownership cannot be detected perfectly during alpha.</p></details>
<section class="panel"><h2 class="strip-title">Your bounty records</h2>
<% if(!bountyBoard.history.length) { %><p class="compact-help">Your placed, targeted and claimed contracts will appear here.</p><% } %>
<% for(const bounty of bountyBoard.history) { const own=bounty.sponsor_id===state.id; %><article class="bounty-history-row"><div><%- include('partials/bounty-attention',{contractId:bounty.id}) %><a class="player-link" href="/game/players/<%= bounty.target_id %>"><%= bounty.target_name %></a> · <span class="gold"><%= bounty.amount.toLocaleString('en') %> gold</span><span class="bounty-status"><%= bounty.status %></span><small><% if(own) { %>You posted this contract<% } else { %>Posted by <a class="player-link" href="/game/players/<%= bounty.sponsor_id %>"><%= bounty.sponsor_name %></a><% } %><%= ['expired','canceled'].includes(bounty.status)?' · principal refunded; fee retained':'' %><%= bounty.claimant_id===state.id?' · you received the reward':'' %></small><% if(bounty.status==='claimed') { %><small>Claimed by <a class="player-link" href="/game/players/<%= bounty.claimant_id %>"><%= bounty.claimant_name??'Bounty hunter' %></a><% if(bounty.settled_at) { %> · <time datetime="<%= new Date(bounty.settled_at).toISOString() %>"><%= new Date(bounty.settled_at).toLocaleString('en-GB',{timeZone:'UTC'}) %> UTC</time><% } %><%= bounty.recorded_claim?' · successful bounty claim':' · historical contract record' %><% if(bounty.battle_outcome) { %> · <%= bounty.battle_outcome==='defender_win'?'Defender won the battle calculation':'Attacker won the battle calculation' %><% } %></small><% if([bounty.target_id,bounty.claimant_id].includes(state.id)) { %><a class="text-link" href="/game/battles/<%= bounty.battle_id %>">Saved combat report ›</a><% } %><% } %></div>
<% if(own&&bounty.status==='active') { %><form method="post" action="/game/bounties/cancel"><%- include('partials/command-fields') %><input type="hidden" name="bountyId" value="<%= bounty.id %>"><button class="button button-outline" type="submit"<% if(Date.parse(state.serverTime)<Date.parse(bounty.created_at)+bountyRules.cancelAfterSeconds*1000) { %> disabled<% } %>>Cancel</button></form><% } %></article><% } %></section>

<%- include('partials/notification-read') %>
